      "created_at": "2014-08-21T23:47:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One of the reasons we wanted to do 3D environments was so that we could have little \"moments\" when cards are played. It's doubtful we'll manage to do that for the initial launch, but it's something we might be able to get into an update. In any case, the biosphere isn't a safe place to be =)</p>",
